WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.424
Not to fill in the same forms,

2
00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:10.258
for the fifth agency this month. Your DBS.

3
00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:11.472
Your registration.

4
00:00:11.472 --> 00:00:14.306
Your right to work. Sent again, and again.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.912
Qura is built the other way round. One profile,

6
00:00:17.912 --> 00:00:18.873
filled in once,

7
00:00:18.873 --> 00:00:20.091
and it stays yours.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.445
Then a person checks it.

9
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:24.914
Registered means you gave us your number.

10
00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:28.046
Verified means someone opened the official register,

11
00:00:28.046 --> 00:00:29.070
and confirmed it.

12
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.588
So hospitals and suppliers can trust what they see.

13
00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:35.060
And the work comes to you,

14
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.098
instead of you going looking for it.

15
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.663
Qura is live. Join today,

16
00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:42.040
and be seen by hospitals and workforce

17
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.291
suppliers this week.

18
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.317
Join by the 31st of December,

19
00:00:46.317 --> 00:00:49.034
and Career+ is free for 12 months.

20
00:00:49.034 --> 00:00:52.070
Your verified profile is free, always.
